[00:28.51]1. The prophets of old sought to learn of the Christ,
[00:32.21]The hope of all groaning creation.
[00:35.81]God’s spirit revealed that Messiah would come,
[00:39.89]Providing the means of salvation.
[00:43.55]The time has arrived, the Messiah now reigns,
[00:47.69]The proof of his presence is clear.
[00:51.29]How great is the favor of learning such things;
[01:00.69]Into these even angels would peer!
[01:10.10](Chorus)
[01:19.50]Our path now becomes ever brighter;
[01:28.90]We walk in the full light of day.
[01:38.31]Behold what our God is revealing;
[01:47.71]He guides us each step of the way.
[01:57.12]2. Our Lord has appointed a trustworthy slave,
[02:00.16]Through whom He gives food in due season.
[02:03.84]The light of the truth has grown brighter with time,
[02:08.00]Appealing to heart and to reason.
[02:11.60]Our path ever clearer, our steps ever firm,
[02:15.72]We walk in the brightness of day.
[02:19.36]All thanks to Jehovah, the Source of all truth,
[02:23.32]We most gratefully walk in his way.
[02:25.56](Chorus)
[02:27.80]Our path now becomes ever brighter;
[02:31.80]We walk in the full light of day.
[02:37.80]Behold what our God is revealing;
[02:43.80]He guides us each step of the way.